Licence of the data in this folder
==================================

The MIT licence of the repository covers only the source code. The data in this
folder are published under the following terms.

1. Farm data of the example farms 2 and 8
   (tables tbl_2 to tbl_7 and Katalog_Betriebe in 2026_10_13_Alle_Daten_Example.accdb)

   Copyright (c) 2026 Johannes Zeidler
   Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence
   (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
   When you use these data, cite them as given in data/README.md.

2. Third-party data (NOT covered by CC BY 4.0 or MIT; the rights stay with the
   publishers). Reproduced with permission for the reproduction of the calculations
   in this repository. Any further use needs the permission of the publisher.

   - Parameterdatei_2024-12_Export.xlsx
     (c) Kuratorium für Technik und Bauwesen in der Landwirtschaft e.V. (KTBL)
   - Feed composition values in Katalog_Futtermittelgehalte_KTBL and
     Katalog_FlowPropertyDefault of the example database (see the columns
     "Literatur" and "DefaultValueQuelle" for the source of every value):
       (c) KTBL (Faustzahlen für die Landwirtschaft, 2018)
       (c) Bayerische Landesanstalt für Landwirtschaft (LfL) (Gruber Tabelle, 2024;
           Deckungsbeiträge und Kalkulationsdaten)

   Full citations: data/README.md.

3. Flow names in Katalog_Flow follow the nomenclature of ecoinvent and Agribalyse.
   No ecoinvent or Agribalyse datasets are included.
